"""HP EliteBook thermal profile dispatcher.

Applies AC/battery power profiles via AMD P-State sysfs, tuned (on Fedora),
and RyzenAdj SMU limits. Keeps the exact CLI, environment variables, state
file format and warning strings of the original bash dispatcher so callers
(systemd, udev, sleep hook, watchers, GNOME extension, power-guard) keep
working unchanged.

Only the standard library is used: this runs as root from systemd/udev and
must not grow new runtime dependencies. Shared sysfs helpers live in
``elitebook_common`` next to this file.
"""

